    {
      "id": "legend-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 542,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "📋 Passo a passo — criar usuário\n\n① POST :4000/api/users (gateway) ou :3000/users (direto, dev)\n② Gateway repassa → users-service\n③ Mesma transação: grava users + outbox_events (PENDING)\n④ OutboxProcessor (~2s): publica user.created no RabbitMQ → marca PUBLISHED\n⑤ orders-service (fila orders_events) consome e reage\n\n💡 orders não tem rota no gateway. Cada MS = 1 banco. Sem FK entre bancos.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 22,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 22,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "legend-box",
      "originalText": "📋 Passo a passo — criar usuário\n\n① POST :4000/api/users (gateway) ou :3000/users (direto, dev)\n② Gateway repassa → users-service\n③ Mesma transação: grava users + outbox_events (PENDING)\n④ OutboxProcessor (~2s): publica user.created no RabbitMQ → marca PUBLISHED\n⑤ orders-service (fila orders_events) consome e reage\n\n💡 orders não tem rota no gateway. Cada MS = 1 banco. Sem FK entre bancos.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
